s or effects** – If the wizard is casting a spell or using his wand, there might be a soft, magical \"whoosh\" or \"pop\" sound as the magic is activated.\n6. **Distant castle sounds** – Perhaps faint chimes or bells from the castle, adding to the sense of a magical, ancient place.\n\nThe overall sound design should be light, enchanting, and immersive, enhancing the magical and whimsical nature of the scene."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 4, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [394.7920837402344, 164.0648193359375], "pos": [-1269.2535400390625, 1201.9970703125], "id": 4, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "125b3a4905ac9367f7aae5c2df67e2282f0a3d37", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.3"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["1手动\n2自动"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [254.11021423339844, 88], "pos": [-1201.8502197265625, 1040.3729248046875], "id": 18, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [21], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": [2], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "text1", "link": 25, "label": "文本_1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "text2", "link": 22, "label": "文本_2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text2"}, {"widget": {"name": "input"}, "name": "input", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "输入"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy textSwitch", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [270, 78], "pos": [-1217.8096923828125, 918.6297607421875], "id": 16, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}